Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:41:18 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix guest registration

- Front desk sent the request without credentials (always 401, shown as
  'Check passport uniqueness') and sent 'phone' instead of 'phoneNum'
- GuestService.create normalises input (passport upper case, phone without
  spaces/brackets/dashes) and validates it; duplicate passport -> 409 with
  the existing guest id instead of a 500; DB unique violation -> 409
- Passport rule 6-20 [A-Z0-9] everywhere, same as the DB check
- Tests 95-98

